<!-- /setup-project: paste Convex's official AI rules for Cursor (https://docs.convex.dev/ai) above or below these lines; keep these lines. -->
- Queries and mutations finish fast and never call the network. Anything that calls an external API or a model is an action.
- Validate every argument with `v`. Check the signed-in user in every public function; never trust the client for ownership.
- Internal work uses internal functions; follow-ups use `ctx.scheduler`.
- Tests use `convex-test` against the schema.
